                        <hr />
                        <h5 class="text-success mb-3">4.1፡ የእንስሳት ግጦሽና መኖ ሁኔታ</h5>

                        <div class="card p-3 bg-light mb-3">
                            <label class="form-label fw-bold mb-2">የእንስሳት መኖ አቅርቦት ሁኔታ ምንድነው?</label>
                            <div class="d-flex gap-4">
                                <div class="form-check">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="pastureEnoughRadio" id="pastureEnoughYes" data-detail="false" value="true" onchange="togglePastureFields()" checked>
                                    <label class="form-check-label fw-bold" for="pastureEnoughYes">በቂ ነው</label>
                                </div>
                                <div class="form-check">
                                    <input class="form-check-input" type="radio" name="pastureEnoughRadio" id="pastureEnoughNo" data-detail="true" value="false" onchange="togglePastureFields()">
                                    <label class="form-check-label fw-bold" for="pastureEnoughNo">እጥረት አለ</label>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <input type="hidden" asp-for="PastureStatus.Enough" id="pastureEnoughSwitch" value="true" />
                        </div>

                        <div id="pastureFields" class="d-none">
                            <div class="row">
                                <div class="mb-3 col-md-6">
                                    <label asp-for="PastureStatus.NumberOfAnimalsAffected" class="form-label fw-bold"></label>
                                    <input asp-for="PastureStatus.NumberOfAnimalsAffected" id="pastureAnimalsAffected" class="form-for-int form-control" type="number" min="0" />
                                    <span asp-validation-for="PastureStatus.NumberOfAnimalsAffected" class="text-danger"></span>
                                </div>
                                <div class="mb-3 col-md-6">
                                    <label asp-for="AnimalWaterSupplyStatus.NoOfKebeliesWithPastureShortage" class="form-label fw-bold"></label>
                                    <input asp-for="AnimalWaterSupplyStatus.NoOfKebeliesWithPastureShortage" id="pastureKebelesCount" class="form-for-int form-control" type="number" min="0" value="0" />
                                    <span asp-validation-for="AnimalWaterSupplyStatus.NoOfKebeliesWithPastureShortage" class="text-danger"></span>
                                </div>
                            </div>

                            <h5 class="text-muted mt-4 mb-2"><i class="fas fa-users me-2"></i>በመኖ እጥረት ምክንያት የተጎዱ አርብቶ አደሮች ስብጥር</h5>
                            <div class="table-responsive bg-white rounded shadow-sm">
                                <table class="table table-bordered text-center align-middle m-0 calc-table" id="pastureTable">
                                    <thead class="table-success text-dark">
                                        <tr>
                                            <th>የተጎጂዎች ምድብ</th>
                                            <th style="width: 40%;">ወንድ</th>
                                            <th style="width: 40%;">ሴት</th>
                                            <th style="width: 20%;" class="bg-success bg-opacity-25 fw-bold">ድምር</th>
                                        </tr>
                                    </thead>
                                    <tbody>
                                        <tr><td class="bg-light fw-bold" data-label="አባወራ / እማወራ">አባወራ / እማወራ</td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.MaleHouseHold" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-male" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.FemaleHouseHold" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-female" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td class="fw-bold bg-light row-total">0</td></tr>
                                        <tr><td class="bg-light fw-bold" data-label="የቤተሰብ አባላት">የቤተሰብ አባላት</td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.MaleFamily" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-male" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.FemaleFamily" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-female" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td class="fw-bold bg-light row-total">0</td></tr>
                                        <tr><td class="bg-light fw-bold" data-label="ህፃናት ከ5 ዓመት በታች">ህፃናት ከ5 ዓመት በታች</td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.ChildhMale" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-male" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.ChildFemale" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-female" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td class="fw-bold bg-light row-total">0</td></tr>
                                        <tr><td class="bg-light fw-bold" data-label="ወጣቶች">ወጣቶች</td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.YouthMale" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-male" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.YouthFemale" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-female" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td class="fw-bold bg-light row-total">0</td></tr>
                                        <tr><td class="bg-light fw-bold" data-label="አረጋውያን">አረጋውያን</td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.ElderlyMale" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-male" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.ElderlyFemale" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-female" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td class="fw-bold bg-light row-total">0</td></tr>
                                        <tr><td class="bg-light fw-bold" data-label="አካል ጉዳተኞች">አካል ጉዳተኞች</td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.DisabledMale" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-male" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td><input asp-for="PastureStatus.DisabledFemale" class="form-for-int form-control text-center val-female" type="number" min="0" value="0" /></td><td class="fw-bold bg-light row-total">0</td></tr>
                                    </tbody>
                                    <tfoot class="table-light fw-bold border-top border-2">
                                        <tr class="text-success">
                                            <td>ጠቅላላ ድምር (Grand Total)</td>
                                            <td class="total-male">0</td>
                                            <td class="total-female">0</td>
                                            <td class="bg-success text-white grand-total">0</td>
                                        </tr>
                                    </tfoot>
                                </table>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>
                </div>

                <div class="wizard-step d-none" id="step6">
                    <div class="p-4 bg-white rounded shadow-sm border-top border-primary border-4">
                        <h4 class="text-primary mb-3"><i class="fas fa-tint me-2"></i>ደረጃ 4፡ የእንስሳት ግጦሽና ውሀ አቅርቦት ሁኔታ</h4>
                        <hr />
                        <h5 class="text-primary mb-3">4.2፡ የእንስሳት ውሃ አቅርቦት ሁኔታ</h5>

